The legal texts are the Constitution of São Tomé e Príncipe and its revision laws, as published by the Assembleia Nacional (parlamento.st, read through the Internet Archive). Laws and other official legislative texts are not protected by copyright under the usual rule of Portuguese-model copyright codes; we have not found an explicit statement of the position in São Tomé's own Decree-Law 02/2017, so this is an assumption, not a licence. No licence terms were found on the source site.
